---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Layout title="Testing & QA · NX-Studio" description="QA manual + automation, performance, accesibilidad WCAG 2.1 AA, security pen-testing. Engagement shapes: per-sprint, retainer, dedicated.">
  <section class="relative px-6 py-20 lg:py-28">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
      <header class="mb-12 reveal">
        <span class="lava-tag mb-4">// qa.v0.1</span>
        <h1 class="font-display text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4">
          Testing & <span class="text-lava">QA as a service</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-nx-muted max-w-2xl text-lg">
          QA manual + automation, performance, accesibilidad WCAG 2.1 AA, security pen-testing.
          Engagement shapes: per-sprint, monthly retainer, dedicated team. Outcomes, no horas facturadas.
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- Tiers -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-12 reveal">
        {[
          {
            tag: 'tier-01',
            name: 'Foundation',
            sub: 'The Stability Subscription',
            price: 'Desde $3,000 / sprint',
            items: [
              'QA lead fraccional (50% estrategia / 50% hands-on)',
              'Test strategy ownership',
              'Weekly quality & risk reports',
              'Go/No-Go release authority',
              'Manual + exploratory testing',
            ],
            accent: false,
          },
          {
            tag: 'tier-02',
            name: 'Accelerator',
            sub: 'The Velocity Subscription',
            price: 'Desde $8,000 / mes',
            items: [
              'Todo Foundation +',
              'CI/CD pipeline integration (GitHub Actions / GitLab)',
              'Module-based automation (Playwright, Vitest)',
              'Coverage report automático',
              'Slack directo con tu equipo',
            ],
            accent: true,
          },
          {
            tag: 'tier-03',
            name: 'Strategic Partner',
            sub: 'The Enterprise Subscription',
            price: 'Custom retainer',
            items: [
              'Todo Accelerator +',
              'Enterprise governance (SOC 2, ISO 27001)',
              'Security auditing (OWASP top10)',
              'Accessibility (WCAG 2.1 AA) compliance',
              'Performance & load testing',
              'Pen-testing básico',
            ],
            accent: false,
          },
        ].map((tier) => (
          <div class={`lava-card p-6 ${tier.accent ? 'lava-card-accent' : ''}`}>
            <div class="lava-tag mb-3">// {tier.tag}</div>
            <div class="font-display font-semibold text-xl mb-1">{tier.name}</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-nx-muted mb-3 font-mono">{tier.sub}</div>
            <div class="font-mono text-sm text-lava-edge mb-4">{tier.price}</div>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-nx-muted">
              {tier.items.map((it) => (
                <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-lava">▸</span>{it}</li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <!-- Platform fee transparency -->
      <div class="lava-card p-6 mb-12 reveal">
        <div class="lava-tag mb-3">// transparencia</div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg mb-3">Platform fee ≠ seat licenses</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-nx-muted mb-3">
          En NX-Studio separamos el <b class="text-lava-edge">platform fee</b> (estrategia, lead oversight,
          reportes, governance) de las <b class="text-lava-edge">seat licenses</b> (horas de ejecución de QA).
          Tu CFO sabe exactamente qué paga por management vs por execution.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-nx-muted">
          No enterramos strategy en una tarifa inflada de junior tester. Es lo que marca la diferencia entre
          renting hours y subscribing a outcomes.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Engagement shapes -->
      <div class="mb-12 reveal">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold mb-6">Cuándo elegir cada engagement</h2>
        <div class="space-y-3">
          {[
            ['Pre-launch o milestone', 'Per-sprint', 'Fixed-scope, ideal para certificar un release o limpiar backlog de bugs.'],
            ['Shipping cada 2 semanas', 'Monthly retainer', 'QA always-in-flight, una sola línea en el presupuesto mensual.'],
            ['Shipping diario o múltiples líneas', 'Dedicated team', 'Equipo exclusivo, mismo squad cada sprint, audit trail consistente.'],
            ['Necesidad puntual', 'Per-test / one-off', 'Compatibility matrix, regression pre-release, spot-checks.'],
          ].map(([trigger, shape, why]) => (
            <div class="lava-card p-5">
              <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3 items-baseline">
                <div>
                  <div class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-nx-muted mb-1">trigger</div>
                  <div class="font-display font-semibold">{trigger}</div>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <div class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-nx-muted mb-1">shape</div>
                  <div class="font-mono text-lava-edge">{shape}</div>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <div class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-nx-muted mb-1">por qué</div>
                  <div class="text-sm text-nx-muted">{why}</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="lava-card lava-card-accent p-8 text-center reveal">
        <div class="lava-tag mb-3 mx-auto">// scoping sprint</div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold mb-3">Empieza con un scoping sprint riesgo-cero</h2>
        <p class="text-nx-muted mb-6 max-w-xl mx-auto">
          1 semana, fee fijo pequeño. Si procedes, se acredita contra el retainer.
        </p>
        <a href="/contacto?topic=qa" class="lava-btn">Solicitar scoping →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>